meta {
  name: This account's Nest allowance, Nests and paid setups (feature `nests`)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/nests
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  The allowance comes only from verified purchases (App Store, Google Play, web) or grants: one funding package per account; any other live package is listed under `duplicates` and never adds slots. `setups` are paid purchases whose Nest is not provisioned yet.
}
